I continued my story.
"The next week, I went to the Infopark office," I said.
"That day, I was very nervous."
"I slowly walked inside the office."
"I found my new desk."
"I went and sat there."
"I did not know anyone in the office."
"Then, a colleague came to me."
"His name was Prakash."
"Prakash spoke to me very kindly."
"He helped me use my new computer."
"Because of that, my nervousness quickly went away."
Hearing this, Sara nodded.
"My first day of work was exactly like this," Sara said.
"I was also very nervous that day."
Kiran and I laughed hearing that.
